OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA rather showery morning to
OL,6,Fcome, with a few heavy and possible
OL,7,Fthundery showers. Showers easing this
OL,8,Fafternoon allowing more in the way of
OL,9,Fbrightness to develop. Temperatures
OL,10,Fnear average.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FAny lingering showers quickly
OL,13,Ffading this evening, leaving a dry
OL,14,Fnight with clearing skies. A mild
OL,15,Fnight to come with a few mist patches
OL,16,Fdeveloping.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
