OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FA dry and bright start to
OL,6,FTuesday but cloud will build towards
OL,7,Flunchtime. A few showers then
OL,8,Fdeveloping by the afternoon, but some
OL,9,Fplaces remaining dry.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,12,FRemaining changeable with a band of
OL,13,Frain crossing the region on Wednesday.
OL,14,FFurther rain likely later Thursday,
OL,15,Fbefore turning drier and brighter on
OL,16,FFriday. Temperatures near average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
